  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Primary path: one move",
      "items": [
        "The board offers only the view's legal moves; a tap or drag calls onmove.",
        "The page shows the move at once (its guess) and POSTs it with the seq it was made from.",
        "The server hashes the cookie, hands Move() to the game's goroutine, plays it with the d8s, and saves the turn before anyone sees it.",
        "POST answers 204; the new view arrives on the live connection as an SSE \"state\" event.",
        "receive() drops the guess, sets the clock offset and hands the view to the animator, which replays the dice on the board and in the tray."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "On the device",
      "items": [
        "No network or a 502-504 (a deploy) keeps the move on the board and resends it every 1.5 s; the same seq means a copy is refused.",
        "A refused move glides back and the reply's view resyncs at once.",
        "The live connection reconnects with backoff and on the browser's online event; a new stream replaces the old only once it is open.",
        "A hidden tab jumps to the end of a roll when it comes back.",
        "Storage holds only conveniences: the remembered name, tips seen, a rematch note."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust",
      "items": [
        "Guests only: the HttpOnly cookie is the login; only its SHA-256 leaves guest.go.",
        "The server rolls every die and lists the legal moves; the browser only replays and offers them.",
        "A stale seq or the wrong turn is refused, unchanged."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Persistence and restarts",
      "items": [
        "A failed save or a panic retires that game, never the server.",
        "At boot the hub restores unfinished games and games ended in the last day.",
        "After a day idle with nobody watching, a game leaves memory; one still waiting for Black expires."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Other routes on the same hub",
      "items": [
        "Quick match: GET /api/match is an SSE line; pairs become a game via CreatePair.",
        "Practice: one guest holds both seats; not saved, never listed.",
        "Resign, rematch, live games list, /healthz, link previews, static files."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Build and deploy",
      "items": [
        "Dockerfile: SvelteKit build, embedded in the Go binary (embedweb), distroless image.",
        "Railway deploys main after CI; health check is /healthz.",
        "Only third parties: Google Fonts and the Instagram reel iframe on the home and About pages."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
